# ⛔ Per-station config. Holds a position (a home address) and feeder/uploader
#    credentials. This entry is the reason the rest of the repo can be public.
#
# ⚠️ Ignore every station*.yml and allow the two templates back by name, rather
#    than ignoring one filename. A real config named after the template it came
#    from (station.portable.yml) is the obvious mistake, and it must not be a
#    committable one.
config/station*.yml
!config/station.portable.example.yml
!config/station.stationary.example.yml
config/*.local.yml

# Captured data never belongs in the repo
*.beast
*.beast.gz
spool/
archive/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
